(7058794, 1073927, 47906, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the Osprey bringing the sticks to the nests, their nests get really huge. I have seen them be 30lbs in weight.  Great detail in the upper wing area.</td>', 'Great capture of the Osprey bringing the sticks to the nests, their nests get really huge. I have seen them be 30lbs in weight.  Great detail in the upper wing area.', '2013-07-01 19:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
