(7058797, 1074090, 47906, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and timed exposure. love how you can see the rccks at the bottom of the lake. and I like that some of the pink hue was captured in the water. Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and timed exposure. love how you can see the rccks at the bottom of the lake. and I like that some of the pink hue was captured in the water. Beautiful.', '2013-07-01 19:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
