(7062215, 1073091, 100393, '<td valign="top">This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier) <br/> <br/>Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more. <br/> <br/>This is one of my 8s - I like it. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me:<br/> <br/>1. I''m a fan of nudes and this one is really, really good.<br/> <br/>2. Excellent rib definition - models love to show them off.<br/> <br/>3. Really effective coloration.<br/> <br/>4. Standout lighting - excellent balance of highlight, shadow, transmission, reflection.<br/> <br/>5. I really like the twisted fabric at the top of the image.<br/> <br/>Great stuff - I wish I had shot it.</td>', 'This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier)  Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more.  This is one of my 8s - I like it. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me: 1. I''m a fan of nudes and this one is really, really good. 2. Excellent rib definition - models love to show them off. 3. Really effective coloration. 4. Standout lighting - excellent balance of highlight, shadow, transmission, reflection. 5. I really like the twisted fabric at the top of the image. Great stuff - I wish I had shot it.', '2013-07-07 20:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7062217, 1072499, 100393, '<td valign="top">This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier) <br/> <br/>Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more. <br/> <br/>This is one of my 8s - I like it. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me:<br/> <br/>1. Excellent mood - great communication, it takes us there.<br/> <br/>2. Brilliantly judged exposure, silhouette works and street is perfectly captured.<br/> <br/>3, Great POV and composition.<br/> <br/>4. Effective tones.<br/> <br/>Overall, a very interesting and enjoyable image.</td>', 'This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier)  Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more.  This is one of my 8s - I like it. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me: 1. Excellent mood - great communication, it takes us there. 2. Brilliantly judged exposure, silhouette works and street is perfectly captured. 3, Great POV and composition. 4. Effective tones. Overall, a very interesting and enjoyable image.', '2013-07-07 20:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
