(7062653, 1074049, 162801, '<td valign="top">thanks for the comments everyone!<br/> <br/>I actually decided to not crop out the top and bottom because it gave a sense of where the photograph was taken (dumbo, brooklyn)...i like the different textures and colors...plus...there are bricks everywhere. the title was not referring solely to the bluish brick wall...<br/> <br/>@MeMex,i like to shoot my subjects dead center when shooting wide...and it was a caught moment.<br/> <br/>but i do really appreciate all the feedback, comments and suggestions!  <br/> <br/>regards</td>', 'thanks for the comments everyone! I actually decided to not crop out the top and bottom because it gave a sense of where the photograph was taken (dumbo, brooklyn)...i like the different textures and colors...plus...there are bricks everywhere. the title was not referring solely to the bluish brick wall... @MeMex,i like to shoot my subjects dead center when shooting wide...and it was a caught moment. but i do really appreciate all the feedback, comments and suggestions!   regards', '2013-07-08 13:23:08.000000', NULL, 0),
