(7062693, 1074112, 60495, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MaryO:</b></div><hr/><i> Yikes!  Serious storm.  The lightning looks sharp enough to be cutting the sky to pieces.<br/> <br/>I hate to say it, but I see dust spots (or maybe water drops).  I would''ve cleaned those up.  Still an awesome image. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks, Mary, I totally agree with the dust spot issue, I grabbed the wrong file when I uploaded and put in the in the file that had not been cleaned up. Probably cost me a little in voting but still happy with the results.</td>', 'Originally posted by MaryO: Yikes!  Serious storm.  The lightning looks sharp enough to be cutting the sky to pieces. I hate to say it, but I see dust spots (or maybe water drops).  I would''ve cleaned those up.  Still an awesome image.   Thanks, Mary, I totally agree with the dust spot issue, I grabbed the wrong file when I uploaded and put in the in the file that had not been cleaned up. Probably cost me a little in voting but still happy with the results.', '2013-07-08 14:52:34.000000', NULL, 0),
