(7062727, 1074054, 49018, '<td valign="top">Very effective, the out of focus plant in the foreground not only gives a good indication of the barren environment but also suggests (to me, that is) how everything left behind soon blurs and vanishes in the memory, with the struggle of putting one step after the other.<br/>Remarkable image.</td>', 'Very effective, the out of focus plant in the foreground not only gives a good indication of the barren environment but also suggests (to me, that is) how everything left behind soon blurs and vanishes in the memory, with the struggle of putting one step after the other.Remarkable image.', '2013-07-08 16:33:01.000000', NULL, 0),
