(7067790, 1072907, 60495, '<td valign="top">Dennis, very nice shot, I thought the storm looked familiar I was shooting the same storm from a different angle, mine was taken from Parker but my timing was horrible, I would open the shutter for 30 seconds and as soon as it closed the best lightning would go off, happened over and over so I thought I would out smart it and wait about 10 seconds but when I did it flashed early. Still had a great time,  here is a link to a few from the same night.  <a href="//bobcrossphotos.zenfolio.com/p587013460" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Storm Shots</a></td>', 'Dennis, very nice shot, I thought the storm looked familiar I was shooting the same storm from a different angle, mine was taken from Parker but my timing was horrible, I would open the shutter for 30 seconds and as soon as it closed the best lightning would go off, happened over and over so I thought I would out smart it and wait about 10 seconds but when I did it flashed early. Still had a great time,  here is a link to a few from the same night.  Storm Shots', '2013-07-11 22:55:37.000000', NULL, 0),
