(7147059, 1074170, 60173, '<td valign="top">You may not do many portraits, but you''ve done a fine job here capturing her sweetness. Her expression and positioning are engaging. It''s hard not to look at this photo, smile, and tilt your head to match hers. <br/> <br/>I will say though that there does seem to be a slight motion blur, which I would attribute to your shutter speed being slightly too slow for your focal distance. The side of her face closest to the window also seems a touch hot in terms of exposure. I understand that this is likely to create an acceptable exposure on the other side. For those reasons, as a voter, I''d score this lower. <br/> <br/>However, if I were a proud pappa, I''d certainly feel differently about the photo. A proud pappa would see this as their beautiful little girl illuminated with a warm sun glow. You can see her youthful skin and her rosy cheeks. That warm sun that may have blown highlights to a voter also is at the perfect angle to illuminate those rich brown eyes.</td>', 'You may not do many portraits, but you''ve done a fine job here capturing her sweetness. Her expression and positioning are engaging. It''s hard not to look at this photo, smile, and tilt your head to match hers.  I will say though that there does seem to be a slight motion blur, which I would attribute to your shutter speed being slightly too slow for your focal distance. The side of her face closest to the window also seems a touch hot in terms of exposure. I understand that this is likely to create an acceptable exposure on the other side. For those reasons, as a voter, I''d score this lower.  However, if I were a proud pappa, I''d certainly feel differently about the photo. A proud pappa would see this as their beautiful little girl illuminated with a warm sun glow. You can see her youthful skin and her rosy cheeks. That warm sun that may have blown highlights to a voter also is at the perfect angle to illuminate those rich brown eyes.', '2013-12-25 13:22:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7178728, 1072499, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''m admiring this for all sorts of reasons; exposure, point of view, framing, tension, and more.  Then I though how important that something superficially minor can turn out to be. I refer to the water spots on the ground in the foreground  the photograph would be diminished without this enchanted confetti.  And it does also recall a Tom Waits performance art piece  was it ''Chocolate Jesus''?</td>', 'I''m admiring this for all sorts of reasons; exposure, point of view, framing, tension, and more.  Then I though how important that something superficially minor can turn out to be. I refer to the water spots on the ground in the foreground  the photograph would be diminished without this enchanted confetti.  And it does also recall a Tom Waits performance art piece  was it ''Chocolate Jesus''?', '2014-02-19 02:47:35.000000', NULL, 0),
